                <pb facs="0836" n="724" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg724"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5406: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Vice Consul at Viborg</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Imbrie</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Viborg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-16"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                        1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received October 17, 1:57 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>116. Under cover of fire from British fleet, Russian troops are being landed in
                    neighborhood of Krasnaya Gorka with capture of that fort as objective. White
                    advance continues; their troops are within ten versts of Gatchina the capture of
                    which is expected today. Bolsheviks morale [apparent omission] their retreat at
                    times becoming a rout.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Imbrie</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
